
form sink
  link dock, mark private

task console
  take
    format
    like text
    fall text <text>
  take
    color
    like boolean
    fall true
  like sink

task file
  take path, like text
  take
    format
    like text
    fall text <json>
  take
    rotate
    like boolean
    fall false
  take
    max-size
    like size
    fall 10485760
  like sink

task filter
  take sink, like sink
  take
    minimum
    like text
    fall text <trace>
  take
    maximum
    like text
    fall text <fatal>
  like sink

task combine
  take sinks, like list
  like sink

task make
  take handler, like task
  like sink
